Aṅgiras^5 = Utathya. § 641 (Rājadh.): XII, 90, 3362 (the duties of kings proclaimed by Aṅgiras Utathya to Māndhātṛ Yauvanāśva).--§ 772 (Utathya): XIII, 155, 7254 (married to Bhadrā, the daughter of Soma, etc.).

