Anurādhā, a nakshatra. § 569 (Bhagavadyānap.): V, 143, 4841 (omens).--§ 746 (Ānuśāsanik.): XIII, 64, 3273.-§ 749 (do.): 89, 4262.--§ 759 (do.): XIII, 110, 5391 (a candravrata should be instituted, when the moon is in conjunction with Mūla, A. being in his belly, etc.).

