अनुविन्द
Anuvinda^1. § 281 (Sahadeva): II, 31, 1114 (Vindānuvindāv Āvantyau, conquered by Sahadeva on his Digvijaya). --§ 290 (Śiśupālav.): II, 44, 1539 (do.).--§ 561 (Yānasandhip.): V, 66, 2503 (Vindāºāv Āvantyau).--§ 572 (Rathāt.): V, 166, 5753 (do.).--§ 593 (Ambop.): V, 195, 7607 (do.).--§ 576 (Bhagavadg.): VI, 16, 622 (Vindānuvindau); 17, 673 (Vindāºāv Avantyau).--§ 578 (Bhīshmavadhap.): VI, 45, (21), 1742 (do.); 51, 2107 (do.).-§ 580 (do.): 56, 2408 (do.); 59, 2584 (Vindāºau; ordered to attack Arjuna).--§ 584 (do.): 81, 3533 (Vindāºāv Āvantyau), 3557 (1) (do.; fights Irāvat); 83, 3654 (3) (= do.), 3656, 86, 3823 (9) (Vindāºāv Āvantyau; attacked Dhṛshṭadyumna), 3827 (Vindāºau; attacked by Yudhishṭhira, ib. 10).--§ 586 (do.): 102, 4666 (Vindāºāv Āvantyau; surrounded Arjuna).--§ 587 (do.): 108, 5051 (do.); 113, 5240 (fought Bhīmasena; do.), 5245 (do.), 5249 (Vindāºau), 5261 (Vindāºāv Āvantyau); 114, 5309 (do.; fought Arjuna). --§ 590 (Droṇābhish.): VII, 14, 542 (fought Cekitāna).-§ 592 (Saṃśaptakav.): VII, 25, 1083 (Vindāºāv Āvantyau; fought Virāṭa); 32, 1410 (do.).--§ 596 (Pratijñāp.): 74, 2629 (do.).--§ 598 (Jayadrathav.): 85, 3025 (Vindāºyoḥ).--§ 599 (do.): 95, 3526 (Vindāºāv Āvantyau; fought Bhīmasena), 3533 (do.); 99, 3691 (slain by Arjuna), 3693.--§ 604 (Karṇap.): VIII, 5, 99 (Vindāºāv Āvantyau; “gone to the abode of Yama”).--§ 608 (Karṇap.): VIII, 72, 3612 (Vindāºāv Āvantyau; mentioned as having been vanquished by Arjuna).--§ 619 (Strīvil.): XI, 25, 733 (Vindāºāv Āvantyau; lamented as slain).--Cf. Anuvinda^3.

अनुविन्द
Anuvinda^2, a Kaikeya prince (brother of Vinda). § 605 (Karṇap.): VIII, 13, 492 (Vindāºau Kaikeyau), 507 (ºśiro 'harat; slain by Sātyaki).

