अर्जुनस्याभिगमन
Arjunasyābhigamana (“the visit of Arjuna to the heaven of Indra”). § 10 (Parvas.): I, 2, 320 (parva = Arjunābhigamanaparvan).

अर्जुनस्यवनवासः
Arjunasya vanavāsaḥ (“the dwelling of Arjuna in the wood”). § 11 (Parvas.): I, 2, 363 (= Arjunavanavāsaparvan).

अर्जुनस्यवनेवासः
Arjunasya vane vāsaḥ (do.). § 10 (Parvas.): I, 2, 315 (= do.).

