hipaḥ)], (4691), [4741 (Asurendrāya)]. --§ 766 (do.): XIII, 126, 6016 (vāmanaṃ rūpam āsthāya jito rājā mayā Baliḥ).--§ 772k (Agastya): XIII, 156, 7274.

