Śālvarāja^1 (“king of the Śālvas”) = Śālva^3. § 604 (Karṇap.): VIII, 5, 131 (had been slain by Bhīma in the great battle).

शाल्वराज
Śālvarāja^2 (do.) = Śālva^4: I, 4108, 4115, 4120; V, 5974, 6007, 6089, 6093, 6096, 7017.

शाल्वराज
Śālvarāja^3 (do.) = Śālva^5: III, 667, 668, 710, 771, 782, 785, 818, 850, 875; V, †1886 (ayaṃ--i.e. Kṛshṇa--Saubhaṃ yodhayām āsa khasthaṃ vibhīshanaṃ māyayā Śālvarājaṃ, all. to §§ 320--1).

शाल्वराज
Śālvarāja^4 (do.) = Dyumatsena: XII, 8607 (Dº); XIII, 6267 (Dº).

