धृष्टद्युम्नसुत
Dhṛshṭadyumnasuta = Kshatradharman: VII, 5083. 

धृष्टद्युम्नसुत
Dhṛshṭadyumnasuta, pl. (ºāḥ) (“the sons of Dhṛshṭadyumna”). § 619 (Strīvilāpap.): XI, 25, 718 (have been slain by Droṇa). Cf. next.

