धृतराष्ट्रपुत्रनामकथन
[Dhṛtarāshṭra-putranāma-kathana]<BR>(“enumeration of the names of Dhṛtarāshṭra's sons”). § 182 (Sambhavap.): Enumeration of the children of Dhṛtarāshṭra () according to the succession of their birth (cf. § 130). Worthy wives were in time selected for all of them, and Duḥśalā was given to Jayadratha (I, 117).

