Jāṅgala, pl. (ºāḥ), a people. § 561 (Yānasandhip.): V, 54, 2127 (Kuravas te sa-Jºāḥ).--§ 574 (Jambūkh.): VI, 9, 346 (Mādreya-Jºāḥ), 364. Cf. Kurujāṅgala, pl.

