Kaikaya^2 = Vinda: VIII, 521 (B. has Kekayaḥ).

कैकय
Kaikaya^3 § 590 (Droṇābhishekap.): VII, 14, 577 (read for Kaikayo Kaikeyā(ḥ), B. has Kekayā(ḥ)).--§ 599 (Jayadrathavadhap.): VII, 106, 3983 (read Kaunteyena with B.).

कैकय
Kaikaya^4, a king of the Kekayas. § 641 (Rājadh.): XII, 77, 2912 (seized by a Rākshasa). Cf. Kaikeya, Kaikeyarāja.

कैकय
Kaikaya, dual (ºau) = Vinda and Anuvinda: VIII, 497 (only C., B. has Kaikeyau).

