[Karṇasambhava] (“the origin of Karṇa”). § 175 (Sambhavap.): Karṇa's birth, etc. Indra's asking for his natural armour (repetition from §§ 131 (v. Kuntī) and 131b (v. Karṇa); cf. also § 547) (I, 111).

