Karṇasuta^1 (“the son of Karṇa”) = Vṛshasena: VII, 6363 (Vº), 6408, 7540; VIII, †4329, †4343. Cf. Karṇaputra, Karṇātmaja, Kārṇi.

कर्णसुत
Karṇasuta^2 (do.) = Bhānusena: VIII, 2262. Cf. Karṇaputra.

कर्णसुत
Karṇasuta, dual. (ºau). § 604 (Karṇap.): VIII, 7, †211.

कर्णाट
Karṇāṭa: III, 16352 (read with B. karṇāṭṭaº).

कर्णाटक
Karṇāṭaka, pl. (ºāḥ), a people. § 574 (Jambūkh.): VI, 9, 366 (in the south).

