Maitrāvaruṇi^1 (“the son of Mitra and Varuṇa”) = Agastya: III, 8776, 8797, 8807; XII, ††13216 (Kumbhayonir Agastya (Āº, C.) ṛshivaraḥ); XIII, 4771 (Aº), 4786.

