पार्षत
Pārshata, pl. (ºāḥ), the sons of Drupada. § 243 (Vidurāgamanap.): I, 205, 7508.--§ 315 (Maitreyaśāpa): III, 10, 371.

पार्षतात्मज
Pārshatātmaja (“the son of Pārshata [i.e. Drupada]”) = Dhṛshṭadyumna: VIII, †4200 (Somaka-Pºau, i.e. Janamejaya^3 and Dhṛshṭadyumna).

पार्षती
Pārshatī^1 (“daughter-in-law of Pṛshata”?), the queen of Drupada. § 218 (Draupadīsambhava): I, 167, 6405. Cf. Pṛshatī.

पार्षती
Pārshatī^2 (“daughter of Pārshata [i.e. Drupada]”) = Draupadī: I, 6434 (Kṛshṇā), 7326 (do.); III, 215 (Drº); V, 5520, 5565.

पार्ष्णिक्षेमसमूह
Pārshṇikshemasamūha, a Viśvadeva. § 749 (Ānuśāsanik.): XIII, 91, 4355 (enumeration).

पार्थ
