7, 379, 1129, 1507, 1656, 1713, 1747, 1751, 3076, 3077, 3081, 3430, 3490 (Dhṛshṭadyumnamukhāḥ), 3491, 3544, 3926, 4020, 4127, 4496 (Bhīmasenamukhāḥ), 4499, 4537, 4538, 4539, 4881, 5008, 5095, 5096, 5427, 5430, 5459, 5461, 5557, 5679, 6596, 6694, 6909, 6977, 7021, 7022, 7027, 7067, 7112, 7113, 7139, 7180, †7306, 7341, 7576, 7674, 7740, 7743, 7744, 7833 (Dhṛshṭadyumnapurogamaiḥ), 7851, †8163, 9130, 9138, 9290, 9434; VIII, 254, 314, 372, 392, 453 (Vṛkodarapurogamāḥ), 825, 829, 1230, 1244, 1268, 1271, 1337, 1653, 1672, 1731, 2122, 2234, 2235, 2236, 2300 (Yudhishṭhiramukhāḥ), 2903, 2909 (Yudhishṭhiramukhāḥ), 3700, 3702, 4016, †4512, †4534, 4753 (all. to Jatugṛhaparvan); IX, 68, 78, 236, 324, 337, 342, 384, 386, 388, 403, 462, 562, 591, 780, 787, 796, 797, 946, 953, 991, 1052, 1063, 1137, 1575, 1643, 1682, 1785, 1826, 1867, 1933, 3463; X, 9, 327 (ºānāṃ śibiraṃ), 441, 472, 597, 704, 712; XI, 41, (ºpāvakaḥ), 590; XII, 1393; XIV, 2332 (ºānām ṛshabhaḥ, i.e. Arjuna); XV, 506; XVI, 133. Cf. Pṛthātmaja, pl., Kaunteya, pl., Kuntīputra, pl., Kuntīsuta, pl.

