पितृलोक
Pitṛloka (“the world of the Pitṛs”): I, 2292, 4925, 6832, 8337; II, 486; III, 6026, †10248, 11639; V, 1581; VII, 101, 512, 6697; IX, 445, 2881 (different from Yama's world); XI, 250, 593; XII, 11788; XIII, 3130, 3471, 3774, 6101, 6494; XIV, 2776.

