Potṛ = Śiva: VII, 2878.

प्रबाहु
Prabāhu, a Kuru warrior. § 593 (Abhimanyuvadhap.): VII, 37, 1610 (attacked Abhimanyu).

प्रबालक
Prabālaka, v. Pravālaka.

प्रभा
Prabhā^1 (“splendour,” personif.), a goddess. § 270 (Brahmasabhāv.): II, 11, 457 (in the palace of Brahmán).

प्रभा
Prabhā^2, an Apsaras. § 731b (Ashṭāvakra-Diksaṃv.): XIII, 19, 1425 (in the abode of Kubera).

प्रभद्रक
Prabhadraka, pl. (ºāḥ) (“the beautiful ones”), mostly said of a division of the Pāñcālas. § 561 (Yānasandhip.): V, 48, †1842 (yuvānaḥ); 57, 2264 (Pāñcālāś ca Pºāḥ, among the allies of Yudhishṭhira).--§ 570 (Sainyaniryāṇap.): V, 151, 5153 (ºāś ca Pāñcālā Bhīmasenamukhāḥ).--§ 576 (Bhagavadgītāp.): VI, 19, 712 (followed Dhṛshṭadyumna). --§ 578 (Bhīshmavadhap.): VI, 49, 2022.--§ 580 (do.): VI, 56, 2416 (Pāñcālāś ca Pºāḥ, followed Dhṛshṭadyumna and Śikhaṇḍin).--§ 592 (Saṃśaptakavadhap.): VII, 23, 992 (Kāmbojāḥ?, followed Dhṛshṭadyumna); 1026 (followed Bhīmasena).--§ 593 (Abhimanyuvadhap.): VII, 35, 1528. --§ 599 (Jayadrathavadhap.): VII, 95, 3535 (followed Dhṛshṭadyumna).--§ 600 (Ghaṭotkacavadhap.): VII, 162, 7258; 183, 8345 (followed Śikhaṇḍin).--§ 601 (Droṇavadhap.): VII, 184, 8367.--§ 603 (Nārāyaṇāstramokshap.): VII, 193, 8919 (ºaiś ca Pāñcālaiḥ).--§ 605 (Karṇap.): VIII, 12, 454; 22, 870 (), 888; 30, 1230.-§ 608 (do.): VIII, 48, 2243 (ºānāṃ pravarān adahat saptasaptatiṃ, sc. Karṇa), (), 2253; 49, 2333; 56, 2756; 67, †3370, †3376.--§ 609 (Śalyap.): IX, 1, 31 (had been slain, cf. § 616).--§ 610 (do.): IX, 7, 336.--§ 611 (do.): IX, 11, 552 (many P. slain by Śalya); 15, 759 (supported Śikhaṇḍin); 27, 1448.--§ 616 (Sauptikap.): X, 8, 367, 381 (C. has by error Saº), 384 (slain by Aśvatthāman).

