Pramāthin^1, a son of Dhṛtarashṭra. § 182 (Dhṛtarāshṭraputranāmak.): I, 117, 4552.--§ 600 (Ghaṭotkacavadhap.): VII, 157, 6938 (C. has ºthaś cograyāyy api, but read with B. ºthy Ugro 'nuyāyy api).

प्रमाथिन्
Pramāthin^2, a Rākshasa, brother of Dūshaṇa and Vajravega. § 538 (Kumbhakarṇaraṇagamana): III, 286, 16405 Dūshaṇāvarajau Vajravega-Pºau), 16407 (Vajravega-Pºau).-§ 539 (Kumbhakarṇādivadha): III, 287, 16430, 16438, 16435 (Dūshaṇāvarajaṃ, slain by the monkey Nala).

प्रमाथिन्
Pramāthin^3, a Rākshasa. § 585 (Bhīshmavadhap.): VI, 91, 4083 (slain by Duryodhana).

प्रमाथिनी
Pramāthinī, an Apsaras. § 191 (Arjuna): I, 123, 4819 (danced at the birth of Arjuna).

प्रमति
Pramati, a ṛshi, father of Ruru. § 19 (Paulomap.): I, 5, 871 (son of Cyavana and father of Ruru).--§ 21 (Pramadvarā): I, 8, 939 (son of Cyavana and Sukanyā), 940 (begot Ruru on Ghṛtācī), 952 (demanded Pramadvarā as wife for Ruru).--§ 22 (do.): I, 8, 963.--§ 25 (Sahasrapad): I, 11, 1004 (Rurur nāma Pºer ātmajaḥ), 1005 (Ruruḥ khyātaḥ Pºer ātmajaḥ).--§ 35 (Āstīkap., Aruṇa): I, 24, (1266), (1277).--§ 69 (Āstīkap., Sarpasattra): I, 58, 2195 (told Ruru the Āstīkaparvan).--§ 734 (Ānuśāsanik.): XIII, 26, 1762 (among the ṛshis who came to see Bhīshma).--§ 736b (Vītahavyop.): XIII, 30, 2003 (son of Vāgindra and father of Ruru). Cf. Bhārgava.

