Pūjanī, name of a bird. § 647b (Brahmadatta-Pūjanīsaṃv.): XII, 139, 5136 (ºyā saha saṃvādaṃ Brahmadattasya bhūpateḥ), 5137 (śakuniḥ), 5140, 5146, 5147, 5152, 5155, 5156, (5157), 5168, (5169), (5171), (5175), 5186, (5187), (5209), 5246 (discourse between Brahmadatta and P., the child of the latter having been killed by the son of Brahmadatta).

