पुराण
Purāṇa(ḥ) = Śiva (1000 names^2).

पूरण
Pūraṇa, a ṛshi. § 637 (Rājadh.); XII, 47, 1599 (among the ṛshis who surrounded Bhīshma).

पुरन्दर
Purandara^1 = Indra, q.v. Do.^2 = Vishṇu (1000 names).

पुरन्दरसुत
Purandarasuta (“the son of Purandara [i.e. Indra]”) = Arjuna: V, 7308.

