Purañjaya, a Kuru warrior. § 600 (Ghaṭotkacavadhap.): VII, 156, 6851 (will follow Śakuni).

पुरातन
Purātana = Vishṇu (1000 names).

पुरावती
Purāvatī, a river. § 574 (Jambūkh.): VI, 9, 331.

पूरयितृ
Pūrayitṛ = Vishṇu (1000 names).

पुरिका
Purikā, name of a city. § 641 (Rājadh.): XII, 111, 4085 (ºāyāṃ puri…Pauriko nṛpaḥ).

पूर्ण
Pūrṇa^1, a serpent. § 63 (Sarpasattra): I, 57, 2146 (of Vāsuki's race).

