Purocana, name of a man, a confidant and helper of Duryodhana. § 11 (Parvasaṅgr.): I, 2, 380 (ºsya…dahanaṃ, cf. § 213).--§ 71 (Ādivaṃśāvatāraṇap.): I, 61, 2252.-§ 213 (Jatugṛhap.): I, 141, 5645; 144, 5716, 5717, 5732, 5733; 146, 5775, 5776, 5778, 5779, 5783, 5788, 5789, 5797; 147, 5801, 5807, 5812, 5815, 5817; 148, 5819, 5820, 5821, 5822, 5828; 150, 5857, 5864, 5879 (constructed the lac house and set fire to it in order to burn the five Pāṇḍavas and Kuntī, but was himself burned).--§ 215 (Bakavadhap.): I, 162, 6249 (nihataḥ, all. to § 213).--§ 241 (Vidurāgamanap.): I, 200, 737 (all. to § 213), 7377 (do.); 203, 7453 (do.), 7455 (do.).--§ 243 (do.): I, 205, 7510 (do.); 206, 7523 (do.).

