Romaharsha = Lomaharshaṇa. § 707 (Mokshadh.): XII, 319, 11744 (ºeṇa Purāṇam avadhāritaṃ).

रोमक
Romaka, pl. (ºāḥ), a people. § 295 (Dyūtap.): II, 51, 1837 (brought tribute to Yudhishṭhira).

