रुचि
Ruci^2, an Apsaras. § 731b (Ashṭāvakra-Diksaṃv.): XIII, 19, 1424 (danced in the palace of Kubera).

रुचि
Ruci^3, wife of Devaśarman. § 743b (Vipulop.): XIII, 40, 2263, 2269, 2286, 2291; 41, 2310; 42, 2347 (ºyā bhaginyā), 2350, 2352, 2354, 2373; 43, 2378 (Vipula protected R. against Indra).

