Taru^1 = Śiva (1000 names^2).--Do.^2 = Vishṇu (1000 names).

तरुण
Taruṇa, name of a Gandharva(?). § 266 (Śakrasabhāv.): II, 7, 303 (in the palace of Indra).

तरुणक
Taruṇaka, a serpent. § 67 (Sarpasattra): I, 57, 2160 (of Dhṛtarāshṭra's race).

तस्थुषांपतिः
Tasthushāṃ patiḥ = Kṛshṇa: XII, 1625.

