Utpalāvana, a tīrtha. § 377 (Dhaumyatīrthak.): III, 87, 8311 (in the east in the country of the Pāñcālas, there Viśvāmitra performed sacrifices).--§ 733o (Gaṅgāhrada): XIII, 25, 1720.

