Vasumat^1 (Aushadaśvi) = Vasumanas^1. § 149 (Yayāti): I, 86, 3539 (rājñā); 92, †3663; 93, (†3664), †3664 (Aushadaśviḥ), (†3666), (†3668) (when Yayāti fell from heaven his daughter's sons, among them V., offered him their worlds; they then all ascended to heaven). Cf. Aushadaśvi.

