Vāyuretas, son of Maṅkaṇaka. § 615j (Maṅkaṇaka): IX, 38, 2222.

वायुसुत
Vāyusuta (“the son of Vāyu [i.e. the Wind]”) = Bhīmasena): III, 11095, 11116, †12321.

वायुतनय
Vāyutanaya (do.) = Bhīmasena: III, 11169.--Do.^2 = Hanūmat, q.v.

वायुवाहन
Vāyuvāhana^1 = Śiva (1000 names^2).--Do.^2 = Vishṇu (1000 names).

