 (slain by Arjuna); 87, 4372 (hataṃ).--§ 615 (Gadāyuddhap.): IX, 64, 3613.--§ 618 (Jalapradānikap.): XI, 15, 393 (all. to VIII, 84), 397 (do.).--§ 619 (Strīvilāpap.): XI, 21, 612 (ºsya mātaraṃ, i.e. the wife of Karṇa).--§ 789 (Putradarśanap.): XV, 32, 877 (sānujaḥ, among those who, summoned by Vyāsa, arose from the Gaṅgā). Cf. Karṇaputra, Karṇasuta, Karṇātmaja, Kārṇi. 

